  "notes": "USAGE:\nUsed with する to mean \"to oil\" or \"to lubricate.\" A practical maintenance term used for bicycles, machinery, doors, and other mechanical parts.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {注油|ちゅうゆ}する (to oil, to lubricate)\n- {注油|ちゅうゆ}{口|ぐち} (oil port, lubrication point)\n- {定期的|ていきてき}な{注油|ちゅうゆ} (regular lubrication)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {給油|きゅうゆ}: refueling — supplying fuel to a vehicle, not maintenance oiling\n- {潤滑|じゅんかつ}: lubrication — a more technical term, often used with {油|あぶら} ({潤滑油|じゅんかつゆ} = lubricant)",
